* Incorrect unit conversion
* Wrong mole ratio
* Incorrect valency
* Wrong sign
* Confusing concentration with amount
* Confusing relative atomic mass with molar mass
* Ignoring coefficients
* Using an inappropriate formula
* Reading a graph incorrectly
* Choosing an answer based on a familiar-looking option

Only include traps relevant to the specific lesson.

